        "Description": "Baba Kafe Hudsa is a ridiculous murderer who lurks in the streets of Mumbai searching for his next prey. He was involved in the brutal rape and murder of a poor 3 month old child in Mumbai. He was released 3 days after imprisonment because of political connections with the ruling party. The local MLA ad his goons have freed him and he still continues doing this everyday. Kill this rapist baba and bring justice to the innocent children who have been raped and murdered by this notorious criminal.",
